BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (Fixed spectral subtraction remains a basic ELEC5305 baseline rather than part of a blended gain. Detector) Tj T* (performance will be measured independently using detection rate, false alarms, and latency. Enhancement) Tj T* (evaluation will include STOI [10], SI-SDR, processing time, settling time, transition-region performance, and later) Tj T* (steady-state performance. The saved gain will also be applied separately to clean-speech and noise STFTs so) Tj T* (that speech distortion can be distinguished from residual-noise suppression.) Tj T* ET
