BT 1 0 0 1 0 82.8 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (The dynamic-scene generator, five enhancement baselines, detector ablations, automated tests, transition) Tj T* (metrics, figures, and listening examples have been implemented. In the latest frozen detector audit, the revised) Tj T* (cue detected 23 of 30 scheduled validation changes, compared with 20 of 30 for the earlier combined cue.) Tj T* -0.085946 Tw (No-change false alarms fell from 62.38 to 41.90 per minute and matched latency fell from 0.617 to 0.175 seconds.) Tj T* 0 Tw (However, whole-signal SI-SDR and STOI did not improve, and clean-speech-only false alarms remained a) Tj T* (serious weakness. These results separate a detector improvement from an improvement to the complete) Tj T* (enhancer and motivate further controller analysis.) Tj T* ET
