BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL -0.116787 Tw (The final deliverable will be a reproducible dynamic speech-enhancement auditor containing MATLAB code, exact) Tj T* 0 Tw (mixture metadata, tests, per-case results, transition-centred figures, and audio examples. A useful outcome may) Tj T* (be either a repeatable improvement or a clear negative result showing when simple modulation cues fail. The) Tj T* (main contribution is a transparent account of adaptation delay, residual noise, and speech distortion rather than a) Tj T* (claim of state-of-the-art average quality.) Tj T* ET
